---
args: {"profile": "MaterialProfile", "need": "FunctionalNeed", "mechanism": "string", "events": "Evidence[]"}
returns: "ReuseConcept"
---
Walk every essential behavior of the proposed use. Identify the material property and adaptation supporting it, then seek contrary evidence and unresolved operating conditions. Unknown maintenance history or an absent required certificate prevents qualified status. Preserve the smallest specialist test or inspection that could resolve the gap. Do not convert a plausible mechanism into a safety approval or invent a test outcome.
